You feel an itching at the base of your skull. Suddenly, your right hand starts moving of its own volition, jabbing down to touch the nearby floor in a frenzied but purposeful series of movements. Next to your feet, a stone compartment slides open. It reveals a leather-bound journal within.

{SFX: sliding stone}

{LOOT}

